      },
      "data": {
        "bold": false,
        "text": "One run per clip\n\nFind Clips emits a list of edits, so the edge into Render Clip fans out — everything to its right runs once per clip. Each Caption Clip transcribes its own clip (autoTranscribe) for word-level captions, so a run costs one transcription per clip.\n\nGathering all clips into a single set (and pairing each clip with its remapped transcript) is deferred engine work — for now each clip is an independent captioned result.",
